{"unit_id":"AmmarByFar__dsh-trustedrouter#feature-1","repo":"AmmarByFar/dsh-trustedrouter","commit":"a5cf282307ac5ee76c4cafbd1281190a3992ab6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-trustedrouter** 的功能「按模型设定隐私等级」：在 Settings → Models 的模型卡片中选择隐私下限；界面显示目录中符合条件的供应商，保存后策略随该模型请求发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:489-507","client.js:523-629"]}
{"unit_id":"AmmarByFar__dsh-trustedrouter#feature-2","repo":"AmmarByFar/dsh-trustedrouter","commit":"a5cf282307ac5ee76c4cafbd1281190a3992ab6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-trustedrouter** 的功能「筛选模型供应商」：为模型填写允许或排除的供应商，并可按计费方式和司法辖区筛选；编辑器会显示仍符合条件的供应商。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:154-163","client.js:523-629"]}
{"unit_id":"AmmarByFar__dsh-trustedrouter#feature-3","repo":"AmmarByFar/dsh-trustedrouter","commit":"a5cf282307ac5ee76c4cafbd1281190a3992ab6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-trustedrouter** 的功能「合并 TrustedRouter 请求策略」：对配置网关下的 POST 请求，将默认策略与模型覆盖合并进 JSON 请求体；带路由后缀的模型可继承基础模型设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:77-113","index.js:125-172"]}
{"unit_id":"AmmarByFar__dsh-trustedrouter#feature-4","repo":"AmmarByFar/dsh-trustedrouter","commit":"a5cf282307ac5ee76c4cafbd1281190a3992ab6d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-trustedrouter** 的功能「设置通用请求体规则」：在插件页为网关填写 JSON body 规则；服务端按规则将字段深度合并到匹配的 POST 请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:762-833","index.js:77-113"]}
{"unit_id":"AmmarByFar__dsh-trustedrouter#caveat-1","repo":"AmmarByFar/dsh-trustedrouter","commit":"a5cf282307ac5ee76c4cafbd1281190a3992ab6d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-trustedrouter 会在浏览器打开模型设置时请求已配置网关的 /models 目录以展示供应商建议；目录请求不带 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:278-317","client.js:320-322"]}
